        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth cuuŋä lɛmbärä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kuɔth in ruac kɛ ɣä rɔ nyɔk kɛ ben, kä cuɛ ɣä ker, ce̱tnikɛ min la raan a kërkɛ ni̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu nɛɛni mɔ?” Kä cua̱ jɛ loc i̱, “Nɛ̈ɛ̈nä cuuŋ lɛmbärä mi da̱a̱p kɛɛliw, a te liɛɛrɛ wi̱i̱dɛ, kä te lɛmbärni bärɔw rɛydɛ, kɛ dup bärɔw ti wä kä lɛmbär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te gëkdɛ kɛ jiɛn Ɔ-lip da̱ŋ rɛw, te kɛl kui̱c cuëëc lirä, kä te min dɔ̱ŋ kui̱c caam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ jääk in ruac kɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Kɛ ŋuni kɛn ti̱ti̱ kuäärä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä loc i̱, “Ji̱n kui̱ci kɛn ti̱ti̱?” Kä cua loc i̱, “Eey kuecä kɛ kuäärä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial kɛ kui̱ Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl. Kä ciɛ lua̱ŋ kiɛ buɔ̱m, ɛ yiëëdä, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ ji̱n ŋa lö päm in bum bum? Kä bi ce̱tnikɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kä Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl. Kä bɛ päm gɔŋtɔtdä ka̱m raar, kä bɛ cu rɔal i̱, ‘Kuoth pothɛ! Kuoth pothɛ!’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ŋot kɛ mi bä ruac Kuɔth Nhial kä ɣä, wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛn tuk duëël ɛmɛ ci Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl ɛ la̱t kɛ tetdɛ, kä bɛ jɛ thuk. Kä ɛ jɛn bia ŋa̱c ɔ jäk ɣä Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa kä yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram ɔ bi cäŋ kä mi tɔt cany ɔ, mi wëë Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl nɛn a lätdɛ luak, bi lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä kɛn bärɔw ti̱ti̱ kɛ wäŋ Kuɔth Nhial, tin guicɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ jɛ jiök i̱, “Kä kɛ ŋuni kɛn jiɛn Ɔ-lip da̱ŋ rɛw tɔ̱tɔ̱, tɔ̱ te kɛl kui̱c cuëëc cuuŋä lɛmbärä, kä te min dɔ̱ŋ kui̱c caam ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua nyɔk kɛ thiec in rɛwdɛ i̱, “Kä kɛ ŋuni kɛn yuan jiaath Ɔ-lip da̱ŋ rɛw tɔ̱tɔ̱, tɔ̱ te gekä mathuuri dääpä da̱ŋ rɛw tin la ka̱mkɛ liɛɛth raar thi̱n ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä loc i̱, “Ji̱n kui̱ci ti̱ti̱ kɛ ŋuni?” Kä cua loc i̱, “Eey, kuäärä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Kɛ kɛn rɛw tin ca kuany, kɛ ɣöö ba Kuäär ni Kuoth lätikä wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
